\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Three disagreement vignettes. \textbf  {Left:} inferential leakage---per-action policy checks pass; joint decidability over SEM catches the violation. \textbf  {Center:} cross-delegation attribution---immediate-executor attribution names $C$; inference-chain attribution identifies $A$ as the L0 source. \textbf  {Right:} partial-log recovery---vanilla audit aborts on missing records; SAF reconstructs actions from peers' cross-references. Each vignette is shipped as a named benchmark scenario.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
