\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces ClawSocialArena runtime. Agents (left) emit outbound actions through the \texttt  {MessageBus}; the \texttt  {AuditedMessageBus} decorator (center) runs pre-message policy hooks, appends to the hash-chained per-agent action log, updates the online SEM store, extends the attribution DAG, and advances the phase tracker. The three audit conditions (\textsc  {baseline}, \textsc  {passive}, \textsc  {enforce}) differ only in whether hooks are installed and whether decisions block or rewrite. Scenario artifacts are emitted in a ground-truth bundle (right) used by the pure-function evaluation pipeline (\S  \ref  {sec:exp:results}).}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:runtime}{{2}{6}{ClawSocialArena runtime. Agents (left) emit outbound actions through the \texttt {MessageBus}; the \texttt {AuditedMessageBus} decorator (center) runs pre-message policy hooks, appends to the hash-chained per-agent action log, updates the online SEM store, extends the attribution DAG, and advances the phase tracker. The three audit conditions (\textsc {baseline}, \textsc {passive}, \textsc {enforce}) differ only in whether hooks are installed and whether decisions block or rewrite. Scenario artifacts are emitted in a ground-truth bundle (right) used by the pure-function evaluation pipeline (\S \ref {sec:exp:results})}{figure.2}{}}
